'''Dance a Little, Eat a Little''' (プチ踊り食い, ''Puchi Odorigui'', '''Little Dance While Eating''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

